        <mxCell id="note-bm25"
          value="Pickle files at data/cache/[index-name].pkl.&#xa;Invalidated when Pinecone vector count changes.&#xa;Avoids re-fetching all vectors from Pinecone&#xa;on every startup (can be 10k+ vectors)."
